                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/N6HPGQK3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de l’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei: Fonds Conti Rossini et Fonds Caetani 209, 375, 376, 377, 378</title><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei</publisher><date>1976</date><series><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="page">144–145</citedRange></bibl>.
                    The subdivision in textparts is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ANLcr81">Rome, Biblioteca dell’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei, Conti Rossini 81</ref> according to the description by Stefan
                    Strelcyn in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/N6HPGQK3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de l’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei: Fonds Conti Rossini et Fonds Caetani 209, 375, 376, 377, 378</title><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei</publisher><date>1976</date><series><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="page">207–208</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit">
                    <ab>በስመ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> የቦረና፡ ትወልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው። ቦረና፡ የተፈጠረበት፡ አገሩ፡ ኦሙ፡ ወላቡ፡ ይባላል።
                    መጫም፡ ቱለማም። ያንድ፡ አባት፡ ልጆች፡ ናቼው። ነገር፡ ግን፡ ከኦሙ፡ ወላቡ፡ ሲፈጠሩ፡ አፈጣጠራቼው። እንደዚህ፡ ነው፡ ይላሉ። ክርስቲያን፡ ለክርስቲያን፡ አንዱ፡
                    ክርስቲያን። ሐብታም፡ ከበርቴ፡ ሰው፡ ነበረ፡ የሱን፡ ሴት፡ ልጁን፡ አጯት። በዚህ፡ እህችን፡ የታጨችቱን፡ ልጁን፡ ሲድር፡ ሰውዬው፡ ገና፡ የሚደረገውን፡ ነገር፡ ሁሉ፡
                    እግዚአብሔር፡ ገልጦለት፡ ያውቀው፡ ነበረ፡ ይላሉ፡ ስለዚህ፡ ለሠርግ፡ የመጡትን፡ ስርገኞችን፡ ሁሉ፡ መከራቼው፡ ሲመክራቼውም፡ ልጄን፡ ይዛችሁ፡ ከወጣችሁ፡ 
                    መንገድ፡ ስትኼዱ፡ ከዋርካጥላ፡ አታሳርፏት፡ የጋላ፡ ወንዝ፡ የሚባለው፡ ውሐ፡ አለና፡ እሱንም፡
                    ውሐውን፡ አታጠጧት፡ <add place="below">ብሎ፡</add> መከራቼው፡ በዚሁ፡ እነዚያ፡ 
                    ሰርገኞች<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> ሙሺራይቱን፡ ልጅ፡ ይዘው፡ ወጥተው፡ 
                    መንገድ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> ሲሄዱ፡ ያችን፡ ልጅ፡ ውሐ፡ ጥም፡ ያዛትና፡ የምትሞት፡
                    ስትሆን፡ ጊዜ፡ አገሩም፡ በረሐ፡ ነውና<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> በውሐ፡ ጥም፡ ከምትሞት፡
                    ብለው፡ ያንን፡ የልጅቱ፡ አባት፡ የመካራቼውን፡ ነገር፡ ረስተው፡ ጥሰው፡ ያነን፡ የጋላ፡ ወንዝ፡ የሚባላውን፡ 
                    ውሐውን<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> ቀድተው፡ አጠጧት፡ ከዋርካ፡ ጥላም፡ 
                    አሳረፏት፡ </ab>
                </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="explicit">
                     <ab>የሰዮ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፡ ሰዮና፡ ሊቃ፡ ወንድማማች፡ ናቼው። እናታቼውም፡ ደዲ፡ ትባላላች፡ ሰዮ፡ ሁለት፡ ይወልዳል፡
                    ስማቼውም፡ ዱለቾና፡ አከዩ፡ ነው፡ አንገፋው፡ ዱለቾ፡ ነው። ቀጥሎ፡ <sic>ገርጄዳ፡</sic> ነው፡ ገርጄና፡ የሞጋሳ፡ ልጁ፡ ነው። ሰዮ፡ አልወለደውም፡ አፊሎ፡
                    የጄርጌዳ፡ ሜዲቻ፡ ደለታ፡ ነው። አከዮም፡ ሶስት፡ ልጅ፡ ወልደ፡ አንገፋው፡ አለኩ፡ ቀጥሎ፡ አው፡ ነው፡ ካሱ፡ ቀጥሎ፡ ገላን፡ ነው። ስድስቱ፡ ሰዮ፡ እሚባሉ፡ እነዚህ፡ 
                    ናቼው።</ab>
                </div>
           
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="BoranaYatafatarabat">
                        <label>The Boranā from the land of the Omo</label>
                        <ab>በስመ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> የቦረና፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤ ቦረና፡ የተፈጠረበት፡ አገሩ፡ ኦሙ፤ ወላቡ፡ ይባላል።
                            መጫም፡ ቱለማም፡ ያንድ፡ አባት፡ ልጆች፡ ናቸው። ነገር፡ ግን፡ ከኦሙ፡ ወላቡ፡ ሲፈጠሩ፡ ኣፈጣጠራተው፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፡ ይላሉ፤ ክርስቲያን፡ ለክርስትያን፡ አንዱ፡ 
                            ክርስቲያን፡ ሓብታም፡ ከበርቲ፡ ሰው፡ ነበረ፤ የሱን፡ ሴት፡ ልጁን፡ ኣጯት።</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yawayto">
                        <label>Wayṭo</label>
                        <ab>የወይጦ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yageda">
                        <label>Geda</label>
                        <ab>የጌደ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው።</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yacalya">
                        <label>Č̣alyā</label>
                        <ab>የጨልያ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yasibu">
                        <label>Sibu</label>
                        <ab>የሲቡ፡ ትውልድ።</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yasidam">
                        <label>Sidām</label>
                        <ab>የሲዳም፡ ጃላ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yaleqa">
                        <label>Leqā</label>
                        <ab>የሌቃ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yabonaya">
                        <label>Bonayā</label>
                        <ab>የቦነያ፡ ትውልድም፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yawayu">
                        <label>Wayu</label>
                        <ab>የዋዩ፡ ልጆች፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="YamanaMata">
                        <label>Mana Matā</label>
                        <ab>የመነ፡ መታ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yawara">
                        <label>Wara</label>
                        <ab>የወረ፡ ኣቦ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="YamanaManya">
                        <label>Mana Manyā</label>
                        <ab>የመነ፡ ምኛ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yalalu">
                        <label>Lālu</label>
                        <ab>የላሉ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yabonya">
                        <label>Bonyā</label>
                        <ab>የቦንያ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yaharu">
                        <label>Ḥaru</label>
                        <ab>የሐሩ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yanono">
                        <label>Nono</label>
                        <ab>የኖኖ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፡</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yatulama">
                        <label>Tulamā</label>
                        <ab>የቱለማ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yaliqa">
                        <label>Liqā</label>
                        <ab>የሊቃ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፤</ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="Yasayu">
                        <label>Sayu</label>
                        <ab>የሰዩ፡ ትውልድ፡ እንደዚህ፡ ነው፡</ab>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="YaboranaHagaru">
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit">
                        <label>Ya-Boranā ḥagaru Horr Walābu naw</label>
